      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I fully agree with this. There are avatars out there that are seizure inducing, and I block those avatars for that reason. If someone else, or even a friend, is in that avatar – I don't want to end up on the floor flopping around like a Magikarp because of this major safety issue.",
