  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Sometimes friends use an avatar so incredibly unoptimized i struggle with performance so i hide the avatar globally. However showing a user/always showing friends/always showing overrides takes priority over hiding an avatar globally. I think this should be the opposite.",
